Package: rFigaro
Title: Optimize Trimming Parameters for Paired-End Amplicon Sequencing
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zymo Research", role = "aut",
           comment = "Original Python FIGARO algorithm"),
    person("Andre", "Barros", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "asbarros@igc.gulbenkian.pt"))
Description: R implementation of FIGARO (An efficient and objective tool for
    optimizing microbiome rRNA gene trimming parameters). Analyzes paired-end
    FASTQ files to determine optimal trimming settings for DADA2 and other
    denoising pipelines by modeling expected error rates across read positions
    and scoring all possible trim position combinations.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
